author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Bounded guidance can round trip without becoming unbounded or silently losing evidence; imported windows are validated before writes.
parent: pm-memory-0kwy
body: Follow-up to time-bounded guidance. Existing harness formats do not represent the new native validity contract; export deliberately refuses bounded active guidance with a recall/get remedy until a safe portable representation exists.
